{"id":"658855","name":"洋葱肉饼","author":"_蒍鉨变乖々","authorId":"8010238","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/658855/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"洋葱","amount":"适量"},{"name":"肉沫","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"手抓饼","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"洋葱洗净切细备用。","img":"images/658855/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"前腿肉洗净切块绞成肉沫备用。","img":"images/658855/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"锅中热油放入肉沫。","img":"images/658855/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"适量生抽，蚝油，老抽炒匀上色。","img":"images/658855/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"放入洋葱。","img":"images/658855/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"翻炒均匀炒出香味。","img":"images/658855/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"适量盐调味再少许盐调味后放凉备用。","img":"images/658855/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"手抓饼提前解冻。","img":"images/658855/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"舀上炒好的洋葱肉馅。","img":"images/658855/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"包紧收口后按压成饼状。","img":"images/658855/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"将饼皮擀薄开。","img":"images/658855/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"锅中少许油放入饼胚。","img":"images/658855/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"小火将两面煎至金黄后切块即可。","img":"images/658855/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/658855/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/658855/step_15.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}